  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can disarm a foe with such precision as to place its weapons in the hands of allies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Greater Disarm<sup>CRB</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you disarm a foe, as a free action you can choose to have the item you disarm be in your hand (if you have a free hand), in the hand of any ally within 15 feet who has a free hand, or tucked into a belt, bag, or haversack in your possession.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc145\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
